      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6040056607672438406, guid: 3ddfb414c2d6e1d429b1218438d32362, type: 3}
      propertyPath: steps.Array.data[0].pages.Array.data[1].explanationText
      value: "When you enter the Asylum, you\u2019ll often come across unique events
        or remnants of the old world.\r\n\r\nInteract with them to make dialogue
        choices and claim reward or face the consequences!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6040056607672438406, guid: 3ddfb414c2d6e1d429b1218438d32362, type: 3}
      propertyPath: steps.Array.data[1].pages.Array.data[0].explanationText
      value: In the Crafting tab, you can spend your hard-earned resources to create
        brand-new Robotic Companions or forge Gadgets that will permanently boost
        their stats.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6040056607672438406, guid: 3ddfb414c2d6e1d429b1218438d32362, type: 3}
      propertyPath: steps.Array.data[1].pages.Array.data[1].explanationText
      value: 'Creating new robots requires the most resources.


        Once created,
        they appear with full health and energy, ready to work.


        Consider
        creating new robots when you''re low on manpower, or when your old ones can''t
        keep up and repairs would cost more than manufacturing new ones.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6040056607672438406, guid: 3ddfb414c2d6e1d429b1218438d32362, type: 3}
      propertyPath: steps.Array.data[2].pages.Array.data[0].explanationText
      value: 'Gadgets are assigned to robots to boost their base stats!


        Each
        robot can carry up to 2 gadgets, and you can remove and swap them freely
        at no additional cost.


        Consider producing them once you have a
        stable team, as producing additional workers will be more troublesome to
        maintain and manage.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6040056607672438406, guid: 3ddfb414c2d6e1d429b1218438d32362, type: 3}
      propertyPath: steps.Array.data[2].pages.Array.data[1].explanationText
      value: "Your robotic companions are specialized for specific tasks to optimize
        Energy usage:\n\nDiggers: Masters of excavation. They consume less Energy
        while mining. \n\nDefenders: Built for combat. They burn less Energy during
        engagements. \n\nSpecialists: Equipped with unique abilities, which they
        cast at a reduced Energy cost.\n\n"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6040056607672438406, guid: 3ddfb414c2d6e1d429b1218438d32362, type: 3}
      propertyPath: steps.Array.data[2].pages.Array.data[2].explanationText
      value: "Some robots possess powerful active skills! \nSelect the unit and press
        RMP or Spacebar on them to aim and activate their unique ability using RMP
        again!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6040056607672438406, guid: 3ddfb414c2d6e1d429b1218438d32362, type: 3}
      propertyPath: steps.Array.data[2].pages.Array.data[3].explanationText
      value: "Your main character, the Conductor, cannot fight or mine directly.
        However, its special ability allows the Spider-Constructor to detach from
        the puppet body! \n\nWhile detached, the Spider can perform basic actions,
        but you lose the ability to command the rest of the Swarm. Use this tool
        wisely!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6040056607672438406, guid: 3ddfb414c2d6e1d429b1218438d32362, type: 3}
      propertyPath: steps.Array.data[2].pages.Array.data[4].explanationText
      value: "To improve your multitasking, you can move the Conductor independently
        using \u201DWSAD\u201D, and quickly activate its Detachment ability by pressing
        \u201CE\u201D. To go back to your puppet's body just press \"E\" again.\n\nRemember
        that when spider moves out of the screen boundaries (either when on the puppet
        body or on its own) the game instantly ends!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6040056607672438406, guid: 3ddfb414c2d6e1d429b1218438d32362, type: 3}
      propertyPath: steps.Array.data[3].pages.Array.data[0].explanationText
      value: "In the \u201CSwarm\u201D tab, you can manage your active team. \r\n\r\nHere,
        you can restore their health and energy, assign gadgets to the robots, and
        learn a little more about them!\r\n\r\nUsing the \u201CQuick Management\u201D
        feature allow you to quickly restore their resources in a single window by
        clicking the appropriate buttons."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6040056607672438406, guid: 3ddfb414c2d6e1d429b1218438d32362, type: 3}
      propertyPath: steps.Array.data[4].pages.Array.data[0].explanationText
      value: "In the Swarm tab, you can also click on specific unit portrait to review
        all detailed information about it.\n\nHere you will see their description,
        class, abilities, every statistic and also their assigned gadgets! \n\nOf
        course, to do that, you have to create something first, but you've already
        done that! Let's assign it!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6040056607672438406, guid: 3ddfb414c2d6e1d429b1218438d32362, type: 3}
      propertyPath: steps.Array.data[5].pages.Array.data[0].explanationText
      value: "If you're ready, we can move on to the depths of the caves!\n\nYou\u2019ll
        often face many forks in the road, but you won\u2019t know what lies ahead!
        By using Pulsite, you can scan the branches to see what modifiers they hold.\n\nModifiers
        change the amount of resources and threats, and even have their own unique
        effects, so watch your step!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6040056607672438406, guid: 3ddfb414c2d6e1d429b1218438d32362, type: 3}
      propertyPath: steps.Array.data[6].pages.Array.data[0].explanationText
      value: "Great! \n\nYou\u2019ve mastered the basic cycle of gathering, escaping,
        and upgrading. You\u2019re now ready for the real challenge. \n\nThe depths
        of Aion await you. Good luck, Conductor!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6040056607672438406, guid: 3ddfb414c2d6e1d429b1218438d32362, type: 3}
      propertyPath: steps.Array.data[7].pages.Array.data[0].explanationText
      value: "Excellent! \n\nYou have mastered the core loop of gathering, escaping,
        and upgrading. You are now ready for the real challenge. \n\nThe depths of
        Aion await you. Good luck, Conductor!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8415639917389934182, guid: 3ddfb414c2d6e1d429b1218438d32362, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_FillAmount
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8415639917389934182, guid: 3ddfb414c2d6e1d429b1218438d32362, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_FillMethod
      value: 3
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8415639917389934182, guid: 3ddfb414c2d6e1d429b1218438d32362, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_UseSpriteMesh
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8415639917389934182, guid: 3ddfb414c2d6e1d429b1218438d32362, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_PreserveAspect
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
